#: ../doc/troubleshoot.rst:83
msgid "Activity in the editor: starting OpenShot, loading projects, changing settings, and using the interface. This is usually the best place to start when investigating a problem."
msgstr ""

#: ../doc/troubleshoot.rst:86
#: ../doc/troubleshoot.rst:112
msgid "``libopenshot.log``"
msgstr ""

#: ../doc/troubleshoot.rst:87
msgid "Activity in OpenShot's video and audio engine, the part that reads media and builds the pictures and sound used in previews and exported videos. Detailed engine logging can help investigate playback and export problems."
